<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Quality analysis for the two-stage LLM-based approach. Best scores are in <span id="S6.T2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>, second-best are <span id="S6.T2.6" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span>. The metrics are defined in <a href="#A7" title="Appendix G More details on stage-based analysis metrics ‣ Understanding the Geospatial Reasoning Capabilities of LLMs: A Trajectory Recovery Perspective" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Appendix</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">G</span></a>.</figcaption>
