<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Xie Yu, Jingyuan Wang, Yifan Yang, Qian Huang, and Ke Qu.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">BIGCity: A universal spatiotemporal model for unified trajectory and traffic state data analysis.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">In <em id="bib.bib26.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Proceedings of the 41st IEEE International Conference on Data Engineering (ICDE)</em>, pp.  4455–4469, 2025b.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib27" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zheng et al. (2008)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
