</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Understanding mobility based on GPS data.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">In <em id="bib.bib27.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Proceedings of the 10th International Conference on Ubiquitous Computing (UbiComp)</em>, pp.  312–321, 2008.

</span></li>
      
